      "en": "After her, he took Maacah the granddaughter of Absalom; and she bore him Abijah, Attai, Ziza, and Shelomith.",
      "ko": "그 후에 압살롬의 딸 마아가에게 장가 들었더니 저가 아비야와 앗대와 시사와 슬로밋을 낳았더라",
      "source_text_hash": "dc5a90c0adca3de96fa638f98eddba567c18f3860907bb1a53079ef1837ff480",
      "translation_text_hash": "01be515891a9f5c8ef1d6dbf1365e1939d72113b24abdd6448236bbbda170b87",
